~ start
Teacher: Before we start... What is your name?
do QuizManager.promptInput()
Teacher: Nice to meet you {{QuizManager.user_name}}! Welcome to today's quiz.
Teacher: I'll be asking you a few questions. Do your best!
do QuizManager.startQuiz("res://csvImports/General Trivia.csv")
Teacher: Well done for finishing the quiz!
Teacher: You scored {{QuizManager.score}} out of {{QuizManager.total}}!
do QuizManager.showCompletionImage()
Teacher: Here's your certificate...
Teacher: Thanks for participating. 
Teacher: I will see you soon!
do QuizManager.goToMenu()
=> END